# Version bump required

Before committing or pushing this FiveM resource:

1. Update `fxmanifest.lua` `version '…'` so it differs from the previous commit.
2. Prefer semver patch increments for small changes.
3. Never ship an unchanged version — the version-gate GitHub Action will fail the push.
